Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  more above
  enter                  open the selected setting: integrations, name this machine, or restart tips
  space                  toggle internet access, desktop notifications or tips
  p                      switch internet access in Connected apps
  u                      set the tunnel URL in Connected apps
  a                      add a connected app
  x                      revoke the selected app

 In overlays
 Message body
  esc, enter             close
  q                      quit
  up/down, j/k           scroll
  pgup/pgdn              page

 Inbox
  esc                    back
  up/down, j/k           select
  enter                  details
  a                      approve
  r                      refuse
  t                      answer

 Connected apps
  up/down, j/k           move
  p                      internet access
  u                      tunnel URL
  a                      add
  x                      revoke
  enter                  approve
  r                      refuse
  left, right            change kind
  tab                    edit name

 Proposal detail
  esc                    back
  up/down, j/k           scroll
  more below
up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
